## 4️⃣ Front‑End Components  

| Component | File | Role |
|---|---|---|
| **Navbar** | `src/components/Navbar.jsx` | Navigation, includes “Demon Encounter” link, sword‐status badge |
| **DemonEncounter** | `src/components/DemonEncounter.jsx` | SVG circular timer, shows `animate-demon-pulse`, handles start/stop logic |
| **KasugaiCrow** | `src/components/KasugaiCrow.jsx` | Narrator UI, uses `animate-shake` when angry, reads `crow_status` |
| **SwordDurabilityBar** | `src/components/SwordBar.jsx` | Visual HP‑style bar (`color-hp-full / mid / low`) |
| **ProfilePanel** | `src/components/ProfilePanel.jsx` | Shows XP, rank, bio‑graph, badge icons |
| **TechniqueList** | `src/components/TechniqueList.jsx` | CRUD UI for habits (breathing techniques) |
| **SecurityScreen** | `src/components/PrivacyScreen.jsx` | Blurred overlay + biometric unlock (Capacitor plugin) |
| **ParticleField** | `src/components/ParticleField.jsx` | Background particles using CSS `@keyframes particle-rise` (glimmer effect) |

All components use **Tailwind utility classes** plus the custom CSS variables defined in `index.css`.  

