## 9️⃣ Verification & Testing  

| Test | Tool | Result |
|---|---|---|
| **RLS enforcement** | Supabase SQL console (SELECT * FROM `encounter_logs` as user A) | Returns only rows where `user_id = auth.uid()` |
| **Timer accuracy** | Browser devtools console (`new Date()` before/after) | ± 50 ms over 25 min (acceptable) |
| **Biometric flow** | Android device → app background → open | Prompt appears, UI unblurred only after success |
| **UI animations** | Chrome DevTools → Performance panel | `animate-shake` and `demon-pulse` run at 60 fps, no jank |

